| Float ke kitne types? | 2 — float, double |
| Char Java mein kitne bytes? | 2 bytes (Unicode) |
| C/C++ mein char kitne bytes? | 1 byte (ASCII) |
| Octal likhne ka prefix? | 0 (zero) |
| Hex likhne ka prefix? | 0X |
| Boolean ki values? | true / false |

